{"unit_id":"ff67f7f87bde008af31e","title":"提案六","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b17","raw_text":"提案六 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,539.2860107421875,92.0040054321289,555.2459716796875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b18","raw_text":"案由：同一病人同ㄧ療程併用兩種以上管制藥品的審查原則，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,568.2060546875,559.97998046875,584.166015625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b19","raw_text":"說明: 1. 依據內科審查注意事項，15.鎮定劑及安眠藥使用多種或大劑量 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[36.0,604.236083984375,556.0199584960938,620.196044921875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b20","raw_text":"         應加強審查。(100/1/1) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":26,"bbox":[36.0,640.236083984375,284.0500183105469,656.196044921875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b21","raw_text":"      2. 為避免病人依賴，併用兩種以上(含)管制藥品( BZDs 及非BZDs  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":46,"bbox":[36.0,676.236083984375,564.0599975585938,692.196044921875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b22","raw_text":"         成癮性藥物)，原則上可接受ㄧ種處方作為抗焦慮劑，另一種作 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,712.2360229492188,556.0199584960938,728.1959838867188]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p3-b23","raw_text":"         為安眠藥物。 超過三種以上(含)需詳實載明充分必要之理由。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[36.0,748.2320556640625,556.0199584960938,764.1920166015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b1","raw_text":"       3. 審查時應注意上述該類個案之比例。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":28,"bbox":[36.0,46.136024475097656,379.9300231933594,62.09602355957031]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b2","raw_text":"決議：通過，同說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[36.0,82.15604400634766,219.9499969482422,98.11604309082031]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b3","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,118.15604400634766,43.97999954223633,134.1160430908203]}],"source_quality":[]}